{"body":"# W06 proposes separate NBRC1308 and NBRC1356 owners for the same fully enumerated trace-element preparation.\n\nBoth primary tables give NTA12.8g, FeCl3·6H2O1.35g, MnCl2·4H2O0.1g, CoCl2·6H2O0.024g, CaCl2·2H2O0.1g, ZnCl2 0.1g, CuCl2·2H2O0.025g, H3BO3 0.01g, Na2MoO4·2H2O0.024g, NaCl1g, NiCl2·6H2O0.12g, Na2SeO4 0.004g, Na2WO4 0.004g and1L distilled water. Both first dissolve NTA, adjust pH6.5 with NaOH, add minerals and state finalpH7.0. The unquantified NaOH uses different metadata encodings, not distinct chemistry. Retain unknown titrant quantity and case applicability; no winner or owner merge is chosen.\n\n- Worker06: `A-P-NBRC1308-TRACE`, `data/ingredients/mapped/nbrc_1308_trace_elements_solution.yaml`, `kgmicrobe.ingredient:nbrc_1308_trace_elements_solution`; payload SHA256 `6a8f4ebc4562e888207270f5fce1dfdc425c581494d9183bd6b8aed5e896a2aa`.\n- Worker06: `C-P-NBRC1356-TRACE`, `data/ingredients/mapped/nbrc_1356_trace_elements_stock.yaml`, `kgmicrobe.ingredient:nbrc_1356_trace_elements_stock`; payload SHA256 `5894ab52e5e649cee09bcd3d149d3723ed42cca6661848dcceaf30078bc170cb`.\n\nPrimary sources: [1308](https://www.nite.go.jp/nbrc/catalogue/NBRCMediumDetailServlet?NO=1308), [1356](https://www.nite.go.jp/nbrc/catalogue/NBRCMediumDetailServlet?NO=1356).\n\nReconcile the proposed stock identity before integration, preserving every source occurrence, raw-label restriction, original proposal and review lineage. This does not authorize merging maintained owners. Require one source-backed reconciled payload and re-review of all affected references.\n\n\nExact independent supplement: `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/new-owner-semantic-duplicate-review-v1/confirmed-findings-supplement-v1.json`, SHA256 `e309179928a0130bf05fd34f95f501bb5339bc44e4fbfd6f05ac2d6ebc11345a`. The coordinator independently verified the primary capture hashes and read both complete formulation tables. Live issue deduplication inspected664 issues with no matching finding. Worker06 payloads have now been verified unchanged in published commit `d5a7613c931d45d057eaca7b5ec15280aca76c9e`; original pre-publication snapshot provenance is retained.\n","comments":[],"number":1207,"state":"OPEN","title":"Reconcile duplicate NBRC1308 and NBRC1356 trace-element stock proposals","url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1207"}
